** The engineering library: the specification module of the folder lib/eng/. `eng.constants`, `eng.units`, `eng.numeric`, `eng.signal` and `eng.geometry` are its modules; the constants and the functions are also members of `eng`.
** @spec spec/library/engineering.md#rules-of-import  @feature F-LIB-03  @decision D-238  @tests test/level3/c95_eng_units
module eng is
  from constants export (*);
  from units export (*);
  from numeric export (*);
  from signal export (*);
  from geometry export (*);
end eng;
